        "original_id": "1e884f99-58e7-5b76-b63c-ec068a48e086",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Better Than Ezra, Melvins, The End Records\n- Places: New Orleans, Baton Rouge, Montesano, Louisiana, Washington\n- Products: Artifakt, \"Honey Bucket\"\n- Topics: alternative rock, rock, sludge metal\n\nFacts:\n- Melvins formed in 1983 in Montesano, Washington.\n- Better Than Ezra formed in 1988 in Baton Rouge, Louisiana.\n- \"Honey Bucket\" is a single by Melvins that was released on September 21, 1993.\n- Artifakt is a compilation album by Better Than Ezra that began being sold in 2001 only at the band's concerts and through the official Better Than Ezra merchandise website.\n- Better Than Ezra is an American alternative rock band based in New Orleans, Louisiana.\n- Better Than Ezra is signed to The End Records.",
